 URLs de imagem quebradas e organização visual da lista por decisão.',0,100,'2026-06-18 14:51:41.512','2026-06-18 15:16:51.741','2026-06-17',3,'f943b045-8dbf-44e6-b103-e8b44a875f47','CONCLUIDO'),('30d92e68-a81f-408a-ad4c-228d62a351fb','b2b63e8f-c47d-4615-bf12-ddd948797f09','2026-06-05 — enhance fuel management with new tank monitoring and vehicle catalog features -…','1 commit(s) em 2026-06-05 — rodrigolessa1980/dashboard-Transporte',27,100,'2026-06-14 21:57:47.983','2026-06-14 21:57:47.983','2026-06-05',6,'69a7a7fd-2961-439d-a3d3-65d1705b79f4','CONCLUIDO'),('31c848ec-f8f5-4435-9439-897248f4f64c','a8266323-6c66-480d-bb73-1c31d6b15fb6','Droplet digital ocean, database infra, firewall','Trabalho em 2026-06-22',15,100,'2026-06-22 15:41:07.754','2026-06-22 15:41:07.754','2026-06-22',3,'69a7a7fd-2961-439d-a3d3-65d1705b79f4','CONCLUIDO'),('322a121b-ba0d-4ca4-b1b0-6c82e0e75bf3','422638e7-8e5f-4e13-8073-5c920a6715b7','2026-02-04 — V1.2 - Implement SSE notifications for document and pedido updates, enhancing r…','2 commit(s) em 2026-02-04 — rodrigolessa1980/linha-produ-o-petkov',14,100,'2026-06-14 22:08:25.995','2026-06-14 22:08:25.995','2026-02-04',2.25,'69a7a7fd-2961-439d-a3d3-65d1705b79f4','CONCLUIDO'),('32c5a3f0-4259-41c9-863c-450143d8ca74','a8266323-6c66-480d-bb73-1c31d6b15fb6','Fluxo de convite/Trilha R.4 — eliminar regras-legado.js','Trabalho em 2026-06-22',24,100,'2026-06-25 15:14:34.602','2026-06-25 15:14:34.602','2026-06-22',4,'f943b045-8dbf-44e6-b103-e8b44a875f47','CONCLUIDO'),('372f08ea-5e7a-49e0-954a-6356bcaec59f','e45416e1-3136-4da3-b19f-c56af6b2ef22','Unificaçao de Sistema, Felipe Fernanda, equipe Dev','Trabalho em 2026-06-30',0,100,'2026-06-30 18:34:24.654','2026-06-30 18:34:24.654','2026-06-30',2,'f943b045-8dbf-44e6-b103-e8b44a875f47','CONCLUIDO'),('37b85f78-bc83-48bc-990e-82bb35c180c7','a8266323-6c66-480d-bb73-1c31d6b15fb6','Desfazer monolito de codigo','Claude entrega codigo unificados num unico html, entao foi feito uma nova refaturaçao do mesmo, estava e